        "body": "Hi Caitlin,<div><br></div><div>Hope all is well.</div><div><br></div><div>This is weird. I thought you canceled the meeting. Not sure what's happened. I just created the event again at the same time, Oct. 25th, 11:30 to 12:00. Below is the Google Meet link for your convenience:</div><div><br></div><div><div>\n<a href=\"https://meet.google.com/dzi-igar-vut\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/dzi-igar-vut\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://meet.google.com/dzi-igar-vut</a><br>\n</div></div><div><br></div><div>Looking forward to speaking with you this Friday.</div><div>Best,</div><div>Amin<br><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br><br>\n</div>\n<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Tuesday, October 22, 2024 at 7:20:00 PM, Caitlin Murray wrote:<br><br><div>\n<p>Hello,</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>This was cancelled without a note – was this a mistake?</p>\n<p><span><br> Caitlin</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span><p><b>From: </b><span>Avicenna Sales &lt;sales@avicennaresearch.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Date: </b>Tuesday, October 22, 2024 at 4:37 PM<br>\n<b>To: </b>Murray, Caitlin &lt;Caitlin.Murray@seattlechildrens.org&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject: </b>Canceled event: Meeting with Avicenna (Amin Tavassolian) (Caitlin Murray) @ Fri Oct 25, 2024 11:30am - 12pm (PDT) (caitlin.murray@seattlechildrens.org)</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>\n<b><span style=\"color:red;\">CAUTION: </span></b><b>This email originated outside of this organization. </b></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:100.0%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"paddi